{"name":"Trailhead","hex":"#776c61","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"trailhead","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The beginning of a trail, often specifically a hiking trail.","The initial clue that leads to an alternate reality game."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/trailhead"}],"entries":[{"title":"Trailhead","blocks":[{"text":"A trailhead is the point where a trail begins or is accessed, where the trail is often intended for hiking, biking, horseback riding, or off-road vehicles. Modern trailheads often contain restrooms, maps, signposts, and distribution centers for informational brochures about the trail and its features and parking areas for vehicles and trailers."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Dike_Trail_no._1389.JPG/330px-Dike_Trail_no._1389.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trailhead"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Starting_point_of_Little_stony_man_nature_trail_Shenandoah_NP_2007.jpg/500px-Starting_point_of_Little_stony_man_nature_trail_Shenandoah_NP_2007.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Starting_point_of_Little_stony_man_nature_trail_Shenandoah_NP_2007.jpg/1280px-Starting_point_of_Little_stony_man_nature_trail_Shenandoah_NP_2007.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Starting_point_of_Little_stony_man_nature_trail_Shenandoah_NP_2007.jpg/500px-Starting_point_of_Little_stony_man_nature_trail_Shenandoah_NP_2007.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Trailhead sign","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStarting_point_of_Little_stony_man_nature_trail_Shenandoah_NP_2007.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thu